{
	x: 0.0d,
	y: 13.5d,
	shape: "hexagon",
	text: [
		"The Blast Furnace can be powered with coal, lignite, or any other coal fuel. Like the Iron Furnace, the furnace only uses fuel while actively smelting.",
		"",
		"It can store 16 pieces of fuel in its lower body. When alloying, it will generate Flue Gas which can be piped into a Wood Burner or Flare Stack for some electricity, each operation generates 100ml of gas.",
		" If it is not burned it will build up and exhaust into the air as Soot pollution.",
		"",
		"It can make two alloys, Steel and Red Copper. They have a variety of recipes but these give the maximum product without waste:",
		"",
		"- Steel: Iron Ore and Flux produces 3 Steel Ingots and 2 Slag Ingot.",
		"- Red copper: Copper Ore and 6 Redstone produces 6 Red Copper Ingots and 1 Slag Ingot.",
		"",
		"(Slag is used for Cement later, don't be stupid and store it)",
		"",
		"This process may be accelerated using Hot Air Blast, it will significantly speed up the machine.",
		"",
		"",
		"Trivia:",
		"",
		"- The Blast Furnace was channged in version  1.0.27_X5714, it is now a huge 7x3 machine with far more immersive mechanics.",
		"",
		"- Advanced Alloy has been removed since version 1.0.27_X5719, Steel and Titanium tools have better stats to counteract."
	],
